  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1761871499_8203286_9d966a20ea80490a450b67ca9f696390.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"498\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"110\">About our brand and products:</strong><br data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"113\">Blumaka builds high-performance insoles made from 85% recycled foam, delivering unmatched traction, cushioning, and durability. Every pair is guaranteed to last 1,000 miles and designed to help athletes start faster, stop faster, and move with greater stability. Our lineup includes NonSlip performance insoles, Comfort recovery insoles, and the Carbon Elite for turf toe protection.</p><p data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"902\"><strong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"530\">What makes us different:</strong><br data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"533\">Independent biomechanics testing on 200 pro athletes proved Blumaka insoles improve performance across every sport. We use our proprietary FoamLock technology to lock feet in place—reducing slippage, improving energy transfer, and preventing injury. In a study with 200 professional athletes, 90% ran faster, 80% started faster, 80% stopped faster, and 80% were more stable from the knee to the ground. This is real data and real performance, something that anyone can get behind.&nbsp;</p><p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1257\"><strong data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"934\">How affiliates can earn:</strong><br data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"937\">Affiliates earn commissions on every sale driven through their unique discount code. The more code uses per quarter, the higher the commission tier (10% starting rate, with opportunities to move up to 20%).</p><p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1668\"><strong data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1283\">How to promote us:</strong><br data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1286\">Share your honest experience with Blumaka insoles through social posts, videos, and word-of-mouth. Highlight how Blumaka improves athletic performance, reduces foot fatigue, and supports sustainability. Use your discount code in captions, bio links, or team group chats to drive sales. We’ll supply approved images, content examples, and key talking points to make promotion easy.</p><p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"2016\"><strong data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1694\">Other information:</strong><br data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1697\">We’re looking for authentic athletes, trainers, and creators who care about performance and sustainability. Blumaka provides performance reviews, content guidance, and early access to new products. Affiliates are part of our mission to make better footwear while cleaning up the planet—one insole at a time.</p></div></div>",
